  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tPayroll\n\t\tPayroll Help Guide\n\n### How to do a year end EPS submission\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Wed, 23 Mar, 2022 at  9:56 AM\n\nNavigation:\n\nPayroll Module >> Select a Client >> Submissions >> FPS& EPS >> Employer Payment Summary >> Add Submission.\n\nWhile submitting the final FPS for the end of the year please follow this link.\n\nIf you have already made an FPS submission without selecting the final submission box, you can follow the steps listed below to make a final payroll submission for the year.\n\nStep 1:\n\nTo go on the EPS submission tab, alternatively click here to be redirected to the page. \n\nStep 2:\n\nClick on add submission.\n\nStep 3:\n\nOn the EPS submission page, find the final submission box as shown below. \n\nUpdate the Final Submission box as >> Yes \n\nOnce you have verified all the other information you can proceed to submit to HMRC using the button highlighted in the red box.  \n\nOther related articles\n\nHow to do a payroll year-end FPS submission\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115223\">Payroll</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188533\">Payroll Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to do a year end EPS submission\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Wed, 23 Mar, 2022 at  9:56 AM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p></p><div style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 62.5%; height: 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/ac8e926cb6794d0dbd6351d08ac694b5\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation\"></iframe></div><p data-identifyelement=\"483\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"484\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"485\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"486\" dir=\"ltr\">Navigation:</strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"487\" dir=\"ltr\">Payroll Module &gt;&gt; Select a Client &gt;&gt; Submissions &gt;&gt; FPS&amp; EPS &gt;&gt; Employer Payment Summary &gt;&gt; Add Submission<strong data-identifyelement=\"488\" dir=\"ltr\">.</strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"491\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"491\" dir=\"ltr\">While submitting the final FPS for the end of the year please follow this link.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"491\" dir=\"ltr\">If you have already made an FPS submission without selecting the final submission box, you can follow the steps listed below to make a final payroll submission for the year.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"491\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"491\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Step 1:</strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"492\" dir=\"ltr\">To go on the EPS submission tab, alternatively <a data-identifyelement=\"493\" dir=\"ltr\" href=\"https://app.capium.com/payroll/submissions/default.aspx\">click here</a> to be redirected to the page.&nbsp;</p><p data-identifyelement=\"494\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"495\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"496\"></strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"497\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"498\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9154428504/original/FBmDOHPYx8EdSghu7tZNYNnXLlSvx4tf4Q.png?1647629222\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"9154428504\" data-identifyelement=\"499\"></strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"500\"><br data-identifyelement=\"501\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"502\"><br data-identifyelement=\"503\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"504\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Step 2:</strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"505\" dir=\"ltr\">Click on add submission.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"506\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9154429043/original/yfctpOy3Uk1EDsHp7YGmwrDxVhi4MSuRCQ.png?1647629626\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"9154429043\" data-identifyelement=\"507\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"508\"><br data-identifyelement=\"509\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"510\" dir=\"ltr\">Step 3:</p><p data-identifyelement=\"511\" dir=\"ltr\">On the EPS submission page, find the final submission box as shown below.&nbsp;</p><p data-identifyelement=\"512\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9154429558/original/GYXK9Lve9CG1mAi3Y10L1TvTfjk6-HcBIg.png?1647630040\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"9154429558\" data-identifyelement=\"513\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"516\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"517\" dir=\"ltr\">Update the Final Submission box as &gt;&gt; Yes&nbsp;</p><p data-identifyelement=\"518\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"519\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"520\" dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9154429749/original/B6dFjyGiGVUY0krqnDRCuQN5OrpGKFlh_w.png?1647630180\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-id=\"9154429749\" data-identifyelement=\"521\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"522\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"522\" dir=\"ltr\">Once you have verified all the other information you can proceed to submit to HMRC using the button highlighted in the red box. &nbsp;</p><p data-identifyelement=\"522\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p data-identifyelement=\"526\" dir=\"ltr\"><br data-identifyelement=\"527\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"528\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"529\" dir=\"ltr\">Other related articles</strong></p><p data-identifyelement=\"530\" dir=\"ltr\"><a data-identifyelement=\"531\" href=\"https://support.capium.com/a/solutions/articles/9000165661\">How to do a payroll year-end FPS submission</a></p><div class=\"readonly threshold-input-field kbase-content__title\" data-identifyelement=\"532\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 7px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(146, 164, 178); padding: 10px 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br data-identifyelement=\"533\"></div><div class=\"text__content kbase-content__description\" data-identifyelement=\"534\" dir=\"ltr\" styl